Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/pds/tif_pdsdirread.c
Line: 333
Function: EstimateStripByteCounts
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: td->td_stripbytecount is allocated with CheckMalloc, which can return NULL on allocation failure. The code does not check for NULL and unconditionally writes to td->td_stripbytecount[i], causing a NULL pointer dereference if allocation fails.

